{"ID":"20240205164750-j97a5tg","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205164750-j97a5tg","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164750-j97a5tg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206095527-6bcm5ro\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611100719-rs4bhps\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240621131001-c2un9zq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"134蓬蘽","type":"doc","updated":"20240829112206"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240812094108-qnaul45","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20240812094108-qnaul45","updated":"20240829112206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"错录内容"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240206095527-6bcm5ro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240206095527-6bcm5ro","updated":"20240829081921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于浙江、福建、湖北、安徽、江西、广东等地。\n【性状】\t聚合果，由多数小核果聚合而成，呈圆锥形或扁圆锥形，高0.61.3cm，直径0.51.2cm。表面黄绿色或淡棕色，顶端钝圆，基部中心凹入。宿萼棕褐色，下有果梗痕。小果易剥落，每个小果呈半月形，背面密被灰白色茸毛，两侧有明显的网纹，腹部有突起的棱线。体轻，质硬。气微，味微酸涩。\n【性味】\t甘、酸，温。\n【功效】\t益肾，固精，缩尿。用于肾虚遗尿，小便频数，阳痿早泄，遗精滑精。"}]},{"ID":"20240206095528-fgwlxk8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240206095528-fgwlxk8","updated":"20240829081921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206095528-0atrsj4.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165229-tpoplab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Prope