},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 391px;","style":"width: 381px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山莓 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/山莓 2-20240812092145-gc6mizd.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 381px;\" parent-style=\"width: 391px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240812103556-9v57lpw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240812103556-9v57lpw","updated":"20240829111100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 721px;","style":"width: 711px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蓬蘽 (22)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蓬蘽 22-20240812103556-4f3nkq1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 711px;\" parent-style=\"width: 721px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240611100751-rw47j9m","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611100751-rw47j9m","updated":"20240812103556"}},{"ID":"20240611100854-ywjycwf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611100854-ywjycwf","updated":"20240611100859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓬蔂《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611100854-2ezto9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100854-2ezto9j","updated":"20240611100854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸平。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100854-kjpl1x2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100854-kjpl1x2","updated":"20240611100854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主安五脏，益精气，长阴令坚，强志，倍力有子。久服轻身不老。一名覆盆。生平泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100854-7ur4jq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100854-7ur4jq5","updated":"20240611100854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：缺盆，一名决盆（《御览》）。甄氏本草曰：覆盆子，一名马瘘，一名陆荆。（同上）"}]},{"ID":"20240611100854-vqoddzw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100854-vqoddzw","updated":"20240611100854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名陵蔂，一名阴药，生荆山及冤句。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100854-hgpm442","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100854-hgpm442","updated":"20240611100854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：蔂，木也。茥，缺盆也。《广雅》云：蒛盆陆英，莓也。《尔雅》云：茥蒛盆。郭璞云：覆盆也，实似莓而小，亦可食。《毛诗》云：葛苗苗之。陆玑云：一"}]},{"ID":"20240611100854-jsuh0fs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100854-jsuh0fs","updated":"20240611100854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"名巨瓜，似燕薁，亦连蔓，叶似艾，白色，其子赤可食。《列仙传》云：昌容食蓬蔂根。李当之云：即是人所食莓。陶宏景云：蓬蔂是根名，覆盆是实名。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100908-l7bxmuf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611100908-l7bxmuf","updated":"20240829081503"}},{"ID":"20240611100910-fukhj2x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-fukhj2x","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：蓬蘽"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-uuscvj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-uuscvj4","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-fyvhgjl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-fyvhgjl","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Pénɡ Lěi"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-su0yfxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-su0yfxa","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-jjqas01","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-jjqas01","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 陵蘽、阴蘽（《别录》），割田藨（《纲目，），寒藨（《医林纂要》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-3wsht7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-3wsht7a","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-alqfc47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-alqfc47","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-b7h38cl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-b7h38cl","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-0r5v3bz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-0r5v3bz","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为蔷薇科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"灰白毛莓"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"果实"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。秋季果熟时采收。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-u2f6amv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-u2f6amv","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-mbmwmgv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-mbmwmgv","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘酸，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-rc5ecru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-rc5ecru","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"酸，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-l3is4el","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-l3is4el","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"咸，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-0cyk77z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-0cyk77z","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《食性本草》：\"甘酸，微热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-037zbww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-037zbww","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-kwi7jqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-kwi7jqm","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 补肝肾，缩小便。治多尿，头目眩晕。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-4o7yq6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-4o7yq6n","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主安五脏，益精气，长阴令坚，强志倍力，有子。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-zb2u725","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-zb2u725","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"疗暴中风，身热大惊。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-f4b83ii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-f4b83ii","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《唐本草》：，\"耐寒湿，好颜色。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-vq8ksy6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-vq8ksy6","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日用本草》：\"缩小便，黑白发。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-bv93ny6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-bv93ny6","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《医林纂要》：\"补肺，去寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-ik5n82u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-ik5n82u","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-e00u69k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-e00u69k","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1.5～3钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-97gvjxe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-97gvjxe","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-n5shm73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-n5shm73","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治阴火动眩晕者：蓬蘽（炒）、人参、白术、当归、黄耆各二钱，怀熟地二两。水煎，频频服之。（《方脉正宗》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-hmb8hgg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-hmb8hgg","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治虚极欲倒，如坐舟车，是真阳不足，上气喘急，气短自汗而眩晕，手足冷，脉沉细：蓬蘽（炒）、人参、大附子（童便制）各三钱，肉桂二钱，甘草一钱。煎服。（《方脉正宗》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-jva95a5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-jva95a5","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-27nr1me","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-27nr1me","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草汇言》：\"蓬蘽，养五脏，益精气之药也。此药虽养五脏，充足在肝，但肝主发生，又主疏泄，倘服食过多，性味有偏，发生急而疏泄多，未免有反激之患，而肝木自戕其体矣，慎之慎之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-14om90y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-14om90y","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-i2udk6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-i2udk6j","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-y4xd93n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-y4xd93n","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：蓬蘽"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-xvid0xc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-xvid0xc","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-36vqj2r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-36vqj2r","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Pénɡ Lěi"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-a8sgr01","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-a8sgr01","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-prvviut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-prvviut","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 覆盆、陵蘽、阴蘽、割田藨、寒莓、寒藨"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-n89d7yo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-n89d7yo","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-e1w9nox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-e1w9nox","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Fruit of Greywhitehair Raspberry"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-cj1630w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-cj1630w","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-op0hdwj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-op0hdwj","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》；1.《本草拾遗》：蓬蘽，其类有三种，四月熟，甘美如霞盆子者是也，余不堪八药。今人取茅莓当覆盆误矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-kwol13r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-kwol13r","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《食性本草》：诸家本草皆说蓬蘽是覆盆子根，今观采取之家核草木类所说，自有蓬蘽似蚕葛，子红色，其叶似野蔷戳，有刺，食之酸甘愿'，恐诸家不识，误说是覆盆子也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-kbedlr4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-kbedlr4","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草会编》：蓬，微人谓之寒萄，沿堑作丛，蔓生。茎小叶密，多刺，其实四、五十颗作一朵，一朵大如"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-dlxcryo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-dlxcryo","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-xxj9fde","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-xxj9fde","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为蔷薇科植物灰白毛莓的果实。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-1ue8ujm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-1ue8ujm","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Rubus tephrodes Hance"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-bljn38v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-bljn38v","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋季果熟时采收，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-vg3j0bd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-vg3j0bd","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-yn35ges","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-yn35ges","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于海拔1500m的山坡、路旁或灌丛中。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-zz5q9jm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-zz5q9jm","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于安徽、江西、福建、台湾、湖北、湖南、广东、广西、贵州等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-704omni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-704omni","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-kxjpzbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-kxjpzbj","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 灰白毛莓 落叶灌木，高3-4m。小枝及老叶柄具针状刺和灰白色绒毛，杂生腺毛。单叶互生，纸质；叶柄长1.5-3cm；托叶三角状，深条裂；叶片近圆形或广卵形，长宽各约4.5-8（-11）cm，先端短尖，基部心形，边缘有浅缺刻和不整齐的细锯齿，上面主脉上具疏短毛，下面密生灰白色茸毛，侧脉3-4对。圆锥花序顶生，总花梗及花梗密被茸毛；花萼5裂；花瓣5，白色；雄蕊多数；雌蕊多数。聚合果近圆形，直径达1.4cm，紫褐色。花期6-8月，果期8-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-pe3uoqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-pe3uoqm","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-z9hgnxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-z9hgnxy","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝、肾经"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-yhud8hb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-yhud8hb","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-2rsmlwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-2rsmlwa","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘酸；温"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-jxmy7ek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-jxmy7ek","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-d5ls87s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-d5ls87s","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 补肾益精，缩尿。主多尿，阳痿，不育，须发早白，痈疽"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-wkoem0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-wkoem0c","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-e06z5sy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-e06z5sy","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，6-15g。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-rf1nm4r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-rf1nm4r","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-4ump83d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-4ump83d","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治阴火动眩晕者： 蓬蘽(炒)、人参、白术、当归、黄耆各二钱，怀熟地二两。水煎，频频服之。(《方脉正宗》)②治虚极欲倒，如坐舟车，是真阳不足，上气喘急，气短自汗而眩晕，手足冷，脉沉细：蓬蘽(炒)、人参、大柑子＜童便制)各三钱，肉桂二钱，甘草一钱。煎服。(方脉正宗)"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-ff05j30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-ff05j30","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-h3eoyfp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-h3eoyfp","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经》：主安五脏，益精气，长阴令坚，强志倍力，有子。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-rdl732b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-rdl732b","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《别录》：疗暴中风，身热大惊。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-bydqpnd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-bydqpnd","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《唐本草》：耐寒湿，好颜色。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-lgsvu1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-lgsvu1o","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《日用本草》：缩小便，黑白发。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-y0vk6vd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-y0vk6vd","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《医林纂要》：补肺，去寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-5qocc99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-5qocc99","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611100910-9c2zyl7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611100910-9c2zyl7","updated":"20240611100910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611100659-cwkliqv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611100659-cwkliqv"}}]}